### --- chapter 140 ---

### a) unknown product
GET http://localhost:8080/products/X-99

### a) unknown customer
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "0000",
  "itemQuantities": {
    "P-11": 1
  }
}

### b) invalid customer
POST http://localhost:8080/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "",
  "phoneNumber": "abc",
  "email": "keine-adresse"
}

### b) valid customer with email
POST http://localhost:8080/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Erika Muster",
  "phoneNumber": "+49 931 4711",
  "email": "erika@example.com"
}

### b) invalid quantities
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+49 123 456789",
  "itemQuantities": {
    "P-11": 0,
    "P-12": null
  }
}

